m in every Keychain access group the app can read,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","isActive":true},{"text":" or without: a key under this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prefix, the app’s or another app’s sharing a group, is this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store’s to sweep. Give every other store — another wallet’s,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a Wallet Provider’s registration keys’, another app’s — a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prefix where neither extends this one; a document provider","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"extension’s store is the app’s wallet’s, and shares its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prefix. A sweep refuses an empty one; and the wallet’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mustn’t cover, or fall under,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/registrationKeyTagPrefix","isActive":true},{"text":", nor the prefix","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of its Wallet Provider’s registration key store:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","isActive":true},{"text":" refuses such a store, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/sweepOrphanedRegistrationKeys()","isActive":true},{"text":" a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"registration key store over the wallet’s.","type":"text"}],"title":"tagPrefix","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/tagPrefix","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"tagPrefix"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Options"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"How the store makes and keeps keys.","type":"text"}],"title":"KeychainKeyStore.Options","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Options"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderUserPresence":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderUserPresence","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"holderUserPresence","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/holderuserpresence","title":"holderUserPresence","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Require user presence (Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode) for","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"every signature with a holder key: to present a credential,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and to sign the Credential Request’s jwt proofs, so receiving"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and refreshing credentials as